# Initial install into CVS of dhs-0.16
#
# Revision 1.6  1999/06/17 18:18:00  nhill
# Added the command server to the authorized list.
# Changed the maximum number of processing nodes.
#
# Revision 1.5  1999/02/25 00:12:03  jaeger
# Remove environment and toolpath from config. file.  Added
# AM library application names to the config. file.
#
